1.1.0 (2026-08-13)
- Rebuilt Idle Frameworks around the lower-memory REWRITE2 architecture.
- Split the menu, persistent idle service, built-in renderer, provider adapters, and fullscreen runner.
- Added dynamic optional Pipquarium provider detection and PIPQIDLE adapter.
- Preserved dynamic Mesmetron provider detection.
- Provider holotapes are not bundled and disappear from PIP-CO when uninstalled.
- Added lightweight fullscreen automatic-idle loading for provider screensavers.
- Reduced peak memory pressure compared with the earlier all-in-one runtime.
- Removed production debug viewer, heartbeat logging, and hardware-test registration behavior.
- Fixed provider selection persistence so SERVICE.JS reads the saved CONFIG.JSON `mesFile` field correctly after reload/reboot.
- Preserved the 2-minute idle timeout and existing built-in PIP-BOY 3000 screensaver behavior.
